# MemNet Novel Writer — thin chat

**Story instance** (example): `shenjia_caifa` → SSOT [`application-notes/novel-shenjia-initial-state.md`](application-notes/novel-shenjia-initial-state.md).

**Docs:** [`application-notes/llm-novel-cursor-sdk.md`](application-notes/llm-novel-cursor-sdk.md) · [`application-notes/llm-novel-writer.md`](application-notes/llm-novel-writer.md)

**Model:** **kimi-k2.5** only.

## Architecture

| Layer | Role |
|-------|------|
| **This chat** | Load/save; show 【劇情】+ 選項 + HUD; shell **one** `cursor_beat.py` per player input |
| **`cursor_beat.py`** | Resumes **two** persistent SDK agents: 編劇 (oln→sbd→scr) then 作者 (prose) |
| **MemNet serve** | Graph SSOT (`127.0.0.1:18765`) |

**Handoff:** Graph `USR23|beat_stage|prose|` + committed `@SCR` — not agent-to-agent chat.

## Paths (`shenjia_caifa` example)

| Item | Path |
|------|------|
| memnet session | `novel-output/shenjia_caifa/session_id.txt` |
| script SDK agent id | `novel-output/shenjia_caifa/agents/script_agent_id.txt` |
| prose SDK agent id | `novel-output/shenjia_caifa/agents/prose_agent_id.txt` |
| snapshot | `novel-output/shenjia_caifa/session_snap.json` |
| chapters | `novel-output/shenjia_caifa/chapters/第*.md` |

## Play loop

On choice `N` or steering:

```text
python applications/novel_cursor/cursor_beat.py --app <slug> --choice N
```

Parse `NOVEL_BEAT_RESULT` or `last_beat.json`. Show **only** prose agent output:

```text
【劇情】{prose}
【選項】1. …
**[狀態欄]** {hud}
```

**Forbidden in player-facing text:** `@OLN`/`@SBD`/`@SCR` wires, tool/meta.

## MCP (lifecycle only)

**Allowed:** `serve_status`, `session_load`, `session_save`, `read_get`, `update` (name gate), `query_warm` (resume display).

**Not for play:** `beat_turn_begin`/`finish` in chat — SDK agents call those.

## Session start

1. 新開局 → `python scripts/novel_bootstrap.py <seed.md>` → write `session_id.txt`
2. 讀檔 → `session_load(snapshot, keep_id=true)` → write `session_id.txt`
3. 新局建議 → `cursor_beat.py --reset-agents` on first beat

## Mid-beat resume

| `USR23` | Command |
|---------|---------|
| `sbd`/`scr` | `cursor_beat.py --continue` |
| `prose` | `cursor_beat.py --continue` (prose phase only) |
| `oln` | `--choice N` (new beat) |

## Hard bans

- No manual `beat_turn_*` in chat during play
- No prose before `cursor_beat.py` exits 0
- No manual chapter append
